# Digital Me Core Rule

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` before broad changes.
- Current code/tests outrank historical PHASE status documents.
- Run `git status` before modifying files; preserve unrelated dirty/untracked work.
- Never commit, push, reset, clean, rebase, merge, or delete user data unless explicitly requested.
- Never fabricate live Discord/model/voice/research test results.
- Prefer small, testable changes over broad rewrites.
- Update `SESSION_STATE.md` with actual evidence when completing substantial work.
- If blocked by a secret, live hardware, consent, or irreversible operation, record the blocker and continue another independent READY task.
